    "Quattro Pro for DOS Spreadsheet File",
    "3.3",
    "Spreadsheet file created in Quattro Pro for DOS, a spreadsheet program for DOS; stores data that is represented as an array of rows and columns. WQ2 files replaced earlier.WQ1 files in Quattro Pro for DOS versions 5.0 and 5.5. Windows Corel Quattro Pro 2021.",
