    "Ability Spreadsheet File",
    "2.3",
    "XML settings file used by AutoCAD, a 3D design and documentation application; stores the visibility and location of user interface elements, such as tool palettes; used for customizing and personalizing the AutoCAD workspace. AutoCAD workspace files are typically stored in a user file named profile.aws. Windows Autodesk AutoCAD 2023. Spreadsheet file created by Ability Spreadsheet, a program included with Ability Office; compatible with Microsoft Excel (.XLS and.XLSX) files and saves data organized as a grid of rows and columns; supports multiple tabbed sheets in the same workbook. AWS files can be saved to the XLS and XLSX Microsoft Excel spreadsheet formats. Windows Ability Office.",
